From 119ebf4f98aca73f91548d1119bf810baca841d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rodrigo Belem <rodrigo.belem@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 02:06:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] niri: fire the GlobalShortcuts portal shortcuts

When a key combination that a portal session has bound is pressed, send the
Activated signal and keep the key press away from the focused client: a
global shortcut is global. Send the Deactivated signal when the key is
released.

Also add the portal backend file, the D-Bus activation file and the
portals.conf entry that make xdg-desktop-portal prefer this backend.
